msgstr "ଛବି ଅପଲୋଡ୍‌ ସକ୍ରିୟ କରନ୍ତୁ"

msgid "Storage: @name"
msgstr "ସ୍ଟୋରେଜ୍: @name"

msgid ""
"A directory relative to Drupal's files directory where uploaded images "
